                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Verdana'>&apos;Viewed&apos; Impressions refer to the on-view event triggered when a user has seen the vendor. This is different from &apos;Loaded&apos; impression, which refers to all vendors loaded</run>
